# Skill runs write deliverables and scratch into the launch directory, which is
# this repo whenever omni is exercised from a checkout. The canonical user-facing
# folder is outputs/; older per-kind siblings stay ignored so leftovers do not
# re-enter git. Walkthrough catalog launches use --out outputs_walkthrough so
# validation PPTX/figures stay out of git status and out of real outputs/.
out/
outputs/
outputs_walkthrough/
artifacts/
figures/
reports/
presentation/
papers/
presentations/
/scripts/
/references/
/reviews/
/review-sections/
/s2_results.json
.soulagent/
role.md
*.sqlite3.init.lock
.playwright-cli/
